// Release build configuration.
// Journal stays on-device. Spec 042 verification keys are optional: missing
// values make FeedbackSyncService a no-op so a fresh clone still builds.
//
// NOTE ON THE SLASH VARIABLE: xcconfig treats `//` as a comment, so writing
// `SUPABASE_URL = https://host` silently truncates the value to `https:`.
// That is not theoretical — it is what Supabase.xcconfig.example used to say,
// so anyone who followed the README got a malformed endpoint and every
// verification upload failed quietly. Compose the slashes through a variable.
SUPABASE_SLASH = /
SUPABASE_URL =
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY =
#include? "Supabase.xcconfig"
